re prezentă în modelele <a href=\"/brand/reima/\">Reima</a> pentru copii.</p><ul><li><strong>Brand:</strong> Reima</li><li><strong>Model:</strong> RANTAAN</li><li><strong>Material:</strong> textil (partea superioară)</li><li><strong>Închidere:</strong> velcro</li><li><strong>Categorie:</strong> pantofi barefoot</li><li><strong>Caracteristici:</strong> drop zero, talpă flexibilă, branț Happy Fit, fără PFAS</li></ul>','Pantofi Reima Unisex RANTAAN barefoot Roz','','publish','closed','closed','','reima-rantaan-incaltaminte-barefoot-pentru-copii-roz-marime','','','2026-10-12 21:03:34','2026-10-12 21:03:34','',0,'http://hainutero.local/produs/reima-rantaan-incaltaminte-barefoot-pentru-copii-roz-marime/',0,'product','',0),(14508,0,'2026-08-11 14:06:15','2026-08-11 14:06:15','<p>Pantofi Geox pentru copii, din colecția Geox. Mărimile disponibile și stocul la fiecare magazin le vezi mai sus, actualizate periodic.</p><p class=\"product-interlinks\">Vezi mai multe: <a href=\"/categorie/incaltaminte-unisex/\">încălțăminte unisex</a> · <a href=\"/categorie/unisex-incaltaminte-pantofi/\">pantofi</a> · <a href=\"/brand/geox/\">toate produsele Geox</a>.</p>','Pantofi Geox Unisex THELEVEN Negru','','publish','closed','closed','','geox-j-theleven-incaltaminte-pentru-copii-negru-marime','','','2026-10-12 21:03:33','2026-10-12 21:03:33','',0,'http://hainutero.local/produs/geox-j-theleven-incaltaminte-pentru-copii-negru-marime/',0,'product','',0),(14509,0,'2026-08-11 14:06:16','2026-08-11 14:06:16','','Matt COOLMAX ECO Fular circular copii','','draft','closed','closed','','matt-coolmax-eco-fular-circular-copii-albastru-marime','','','2026-08-11 14:06:16','2026-08-11 14:06:16','',0,'http://hainutero.local/produs/matt-coolmax-eco-fular-circular-copii-albastru-marime/',0,'product','',0),(14510,0,'2026-08-11 14:06:16','2026-08-11 14:06:16','','LOAP ZONK Căciulă de iarnă copii','','draft','closed','closed','','loap-zonk-caciula-de-iarna-copii-mov-marime','','','2026-08-11 14:06:16','2026-08-